  "prefLabel": "Bar 101.35 Non-porous",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 101.35 “Non-porous” means a material that does not permit air, fluids, or solid substances to be absorbed or to pass through. A non-porous item or implement is cleaned and disinfected before reuse.\n\nSource. #14459, eff 1-1-26",
